  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DELF-Jerusalem Unites US (JUU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#xB4;s long term goal is peaceful co existence in Jerusalem, but for this project phase, focus is on co existence between Christians and Muslims in East Jerusalem (EJ). Main outputs are a magazine that emphasizes the contribution of both religions to the city of Jerusalem. Further, JUU works with certain target schools in EJ, and with Muslim and Christian Civil Society groups.</narrative>
  </description>
